The terrain shading downloads elevation tiles from AWS Open Data, produced by
the Mapzen / tilezen joerd project. Those data providers require attribution,
given in licenses/TERRAIN-TILES.md.

The photograph in images/ and the 3D models in enclosure/ are the author's own
work and are not covered by the MIT license above.
